{"projectInfo":{"name":"NGFW双向NAT（等同NAT hairpin）配置实验","path":"ercinat","visibility":2,"categoryId":151,"introduction":"虚拟机PC_3和PC_4同网段，但是需要用nat server global地址去访问，由于同网段，如果不做源地址转换，回程PC_4会直接通过交换机发给PC_3，因此需要来回流量都过防火墙，普通的nat hairpin能实现但是有诸多限制，因此使用nat server加NAT outbound的方式实现二次NAT。","label":["NAT hairpin"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"F1060_1","resourceCategory":"防火墙","resourceModel":"F1060","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-A7164","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\F1060_1.cfg"},{"resourceName":"PC_4","resourceCategory":"终端设备","resourceModel":"PC","resourceVersion":"","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\PC_4.cfg"},{"resourceName":"S5820V2-54QS-GE_2","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S5820V2-54QS-GE","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.075-A7571","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\S5820V2-54QS-GE_2.cfg"},{"resourceName":"PC_3","resourceCategory":"终端设备","resourceModel":"PC","resourceVersion":"","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\PC_3.cfg"}]}